	(text "1. Add test points\n2. Add BMP280 silkscreen marker\n3. Fix servo connections to PRU r30 compatible pins\n4. Fix 24V and GND screw terminal markers\n5. Connect buzzer to 3V3\n6. Connect leds to GPIO\n7. Connect buzzer transistor to pwm generation channel"
